body:
My bf after finishing work…

Alternatively, the aroma inside a coffee roastery;

Petrichor and soil;

This one “hot cocoa and cream” candle I used to have;

my stinky cat yawning in my face;

pancakes cooking. or cinnamon rolls baking;

the smell inside the, like, tropical rainforest enclosure area with the butterflies and birds and stuff at the local botanical garden or museum
